From: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Subject: [PATCH] ath11k-avoid-stack-corrupt-in-nwifi-undecap

Imported from https://github.com/kuncy7/openwrt-nss-edma package/kernel/mac80211/patches/nss/ath11k/318-ath11k-avoid-stack-corrupt-in-nwifi-undecap.patch (added in 82c7d2cde8); the patch file carries no author or description.
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp_rx.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp_rx.h
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
 #include "rx_desc.h"
 #include "debug.h"
 
-#define DP_MAX_NWIFI_HDR_LEN	30
+#define DP_MAX_NWIFI_HDR_LEN	36
 
 #define DP_RX_MPDU_ERR_FCS			BIT(0)
 #define DP_RX_MPDU_ERR_DECRYPT			BIT(1)
